  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola whose transverse axis is along the major axis of the conic&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and has vertices at the foci of the conic. If the eccentricity of the hyperbola is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then which of the following points does not lie on the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>?</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "3hXAh",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zOmwf",
      "text": "<math> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5pyJa",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "uhbhz",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
